OL,3,GNEWSAKind strangers help man who broke
OL,4,Aneck return to UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who broke his neck while diving
OL,7,Finto a swimming pool in Turkey is back
OL,8,Fin the UK thanks to the kindness of
OL,9,Fstrangers.
OL,11,FWill Ponter, from Carnforth in
OL,12,FLancashire, underwent a 13-hour
OL,13,Femergency surgery in Antalya, and
OL,14,Fdoctors said the 24-year-old would be
OL,15,Fparalysed from the neck down.
OL,17,FHe is now being treated at the Royal
OL,18,FLancaster Infirmary after more than
OL,19,F#150,000 was donated to help cover
OL,20,Fmedical costs and bring him home.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
